# --- Sources we may redistribute, and why ---
# legislatie.just.ro states in its own terms that "textele oficiale de natura
# legislativa nu beneficiaza de protectia legala a dreptului de autor, conform
# Legii nr. 8/1996", so sources/legea-153-2017.html and sources/oug-79-2017.html
# are committed. They are the portal's *unofficial consolidated* forms - fine for
# public debate, not a source of law. See the ro-153-2017 limitation
# 'forma-consolidata-neoficiala'.

# --- Third-party sources we may not redistribute ---
# IDA's Danish pay tables are a trade-union publication. Fetch them yourself:
# https://ida.dk -> Loen -> Loentabeller for offentligt ansatte, 01.04.2026
# Place at sources/01042026-loentabeller-offentligt-ansatte-engelsk-version-revideret-170626.pdf
sources/*.pdf

